  "bio": "Sarikova is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Saint Petersburg, Russia, specializing in illustrative, fineline, black&gray, and floral styles. Their craftsmanship is evident in how they tailor each tattoo to fit an individual's anatomy, ensuring every piece complements and enhances the person's natural curves. Sarikova is committed to professionalism, transforming clients’ visions into art that feels intrinsic to their identity.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Saint Petersburg, Northwestern Federal District, Russia\n\nNature-inspired tattoos 🌙\n• Large-scale & connecting existing pieces\n• Designed to fit your body flow\n• Berlin: April - May. Booking via website ↓",
